<title>JAPAN: Maruishi Cycle -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Maruishi Cycle -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		   3.9		vs	    4.14</p>
<p> Operating	   22    million	  vs	   38    million</p>
<p> Current	     31    million	  vs	   17    million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 19    million	  vs   loss 110    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 1.76 yen	  vs     loss 9.98 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  0.00 yen	  vs	    0.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Maruishi Cycle Industries Ltd is a major bicycle manufacturer.</p>
</text>
